From a0509fc0bc35a57acdae7446bf517ff3f252e5dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BoJiang03 <bo.jiang@temple.edu>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:50:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [MP] Store GQA KV heads once across TP replicas

Ranks sharing a KV head (tp > num_kv_heads) now fold into one object, and
object groups split by replica count so an MLA indexer is not stored per head pair.

Signed-off-by: BoJiang03 <bo.jiang@temple.edu>
